        "controller_support": "full",
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story</strong>:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mary Thorne books a week-long getaway at <strong>Valley View Escape</strong> with her friend, Carly, to escape family chaos and focus on her project. When Carly is delayed, Mary spends the first few days alone and soon senses an unnerving presence around her. Can she uncover the source of that strange feeling and survive the week, or will she succumb to the <i>Gaze of Dread</i>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong>:  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gaze of Dread is an atmospheric first-person horror walking simulator featuring an interactive world, rising suspense and tension, and an immersive narrative. Focus on your photos and some quiet time before Carly gets there. Each day–night cycle brings dreams that blend with what you’ve seen and grow more intense, as the unease builds and you work to stay calm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong>: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><u>Day/Night Progression</u></i>: Experience sunlit days and hushed, uneasy nights around Valley View Escape.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><u>Photography</u></i>: Capture the local scenery with your camera; photos are saved to a scrapbook.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><u>Paranormal Activity</u></i>: Experience strange events and otherworldly encounters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><u>Dream Interludes</u></i>: Brief, unsettling dreams that grow more intense as the story unfolds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><u>Fully Voiced</u></i>: A fully voice-acted story that carries the emotion and tension.</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story</strong>:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mary Thorne books a week-long getaway at <strong>Valley View Escape</strong> with her friend, Carly, to escape family chaos and focus on her project. When Carly is delayed, Mary spends the first few days alone and soon senses an unnerving presence around her. Can she uncover the source of that strange feeling and survive the week, or will she succumb to the <i>Gaze of Dread</i>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong>:  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gaze of Dread is an atmospheric first-person horror walking simulator featuring an interactive world, rising suspense and tension, and an immersive narrative. Focus on your photos and some quiet time before Carly gets there. Each day–night cycle brings dreams that blend with what you’ve seen and grow more intense, as the unease builds and you work to stay calm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong>: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><u>Day/Night Progression</u></i>: Experience sunlit days and hushed, uneasy nights around Valley View Escape.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><u>Photography</u></i>: Capture the local scenery with your camera; photos are saved to a scrapbook.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><u>Paranormal Activity</u></i>: Experience strange events and otherworldly encounters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><u>Dream Interludes</u></i>: Brief, unsettling dreams that grow more intense as the story unfolds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><u>Fully Voiced</u></i>: A fully voice-acted story that carries the emotion and tension.</p></li></ul>",
        "short_description": "Mary Thorne retreats to Valley View Escape to focus on her project while waiting for her friend Carly. What begins as a calm week starts to feel… off.",
